  "notes": "Every call to scale passes a value the caller zero-extended (uxtb), every call to level a value it sign-extended (sxth), and every call to pick a truth value, so the parameters are unsigned char, short and bool. wide gets a byte from one caller and a whole register from the other, and taken's address is stored in hook, so both keep the register width.",
